WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.138
For years, holding bitcoin meant a choice.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.924
Hand your keys to a company.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.592
Or carry the whole weight alone.

4
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.117
One key. One mistake. Gone.

5
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.447
What if you held three keys?

6
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.287
One in your pocket.

7
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.161
One in a drawer.

8
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.398
One on a shelf at home.

9
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.840
Any two move your money.

10
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:35.718
Everyday payments? Just your phone, and Face ID.

11
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.317
Big ones? Confirm on your hardware wallet.

12
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:45.404
Lose one? You still have the other two.

13
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:51.888
Anything suspicious, you and the people you trust hear about it. Every day.

14
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.745
No company holds a key.

15
00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.411
No server but yours.

16
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.264
No one to ask permission.

17
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:09.940
Trikey. One key gone. Your bitcoin isn’t.
